{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0083_1000_p", "source_sha256": "32edc7be95cab51f89d84cb59298be1ec4928cc4da43ab96c1f7ef5ba2b284fb", "ja": "お疲れ！\n入学式お祝いライブ、バッチリだったな、響。", "zh": "辛苦了！入学典礼的祝贺演唱会，\n表演得非常完美喔，响。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0083_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "dd1f93bc24157ef94cc9aa8943568ab52e706834357614c25ff16f4940f84b9d", "ja": "えっ、ホント！？\n新入生のみんな、ちゃんと喜んでくれてた？", "zh": "咦？真的！？\n新生们都看得开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0083_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d94027e20fd20510fc0937e60cf3c6b422fe9cfbe2dd5a0b57cac6cddfe7918a", "ja": "ああ、客席の盛り上がりもすごかっただろ？", "zh": "是啊，观众席的气氛不也很热烈？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0083_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "ced9f73a6a89e1edb89c0e39ed8fd1aeb66034078c65c042096330d4578cba94", "ja": "そっか……。\nうん、それなら自分もうれしいぞっ！", "zh": "这样啊……\n嗯，这样的话，本人也很开心喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0083_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "3e7b9fd3eb663e6a830419a1a7e4ff96a9bc1679c0989a0711a8c60f793f8ff8", "ja": "……。\nあのね、{$P$}。", "zh": "……\n{$P$}，其实啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0083_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "ebac0e3a69c2f60f408321d448b48c62ef43f849590b4e0eb1eabfc5f468d75d", "ja": "自分、今日のライブをしてたら、なんか……\nアイドルになりたての頃を思い出しちゃったんだ。", "zh": "本人唱完今天的演唱会，总觉得……\n回想起刚成为偶像那时候的事了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0083_1006_p", "source_sha256": "4b7661b5f3145688525eb1d2be9b5751b8350d68d82141962fe3e26b3dd18784", "ja": "アイドルになりたて……って、\n新人の頃のことか？", "zh": "刚成为偶像……你是说，\n还是新人的时候吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0083_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "3749e3da68546f215799116d49dd11b5a0aa39ce1f0bf4ded3f60f6416daf546", "ja": "うん、今日の客席にいた新入生たちみたいに、\nアイドルになって、目をキラキラさせてた時のこと。", "zh": "嗯，那时本人就像今天观众席上的新生一样，\n刚成为偶像，眼神闪闪发亮。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0083_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "a3681dab3a565d47488ac78b12e3be5330a6b08dc458fa45cccc7ac43fa5913a", "ja": "あれからいっぱいレッスンして、いっぱい歌って、\n踊って、ファンのみんなにも応援してもらって……。", "zh": "从那时候以来，本人做了好多训练，唱了好多歌，\n跳了好多舞，还获得许多粉丝支持……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0083_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "fb8f58b20ea9899ec5e2b19d704f373f4487599e5e6609b761818e5278eb8a5f", "ja": "トップアイドルを目指して突っ走ってきたけど、\n自分、あの頃より……ちゃんとできてるよね？", "zh": "以顶尖偶像为目标一路冲到现在，\n比起那时候……本人应该有进步吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0083_1010_p", "source_sha256": "7aefade4501473a77dc7795b4bb7f41d67f399c61615d55dbac38c1fe74a8fc8", "ja": "もちろん。今日のライブが盛り上がったのだって、\n偶然とかじゃなくて……。", "zh": "那当然，今天的演唱会气氛这么热烈，\n并不是偶然……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0083_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c0898d19b0ddb198ccd1542a7517980090ec3eac4e9437cce26dad34d11ddff8", "ja": "響がずっと突っ走って来たからこそ、じゃないかな。", "zh": "而是响一路冲刺过来的成果吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0083_1012_013hib", "source_sha256": "892d0108f880938aec155f36ec78cab4d3528e397babc0b1bc75938495c891e9", "ja": "……。えへへ、そうだよねっ！　\nそれなら安心だぞ～。", "zh": "……嘿嘿，说得也是！\n那本人就放心了喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0083_1013_013hib", "source_sha256": "65fdd6aa5e51654ec2aedf6c0cbcf3633f5bd60b45d4a3a9844e57f5bf8fc09c", "ja": "ほら、自分、劇場では先輩だし。ちゃんとできてるか、\n確かめておきたかったんだ。……ちょっとだけね！", "zh": "毕竟，本人在剧场也算是前辈，所以才会想确认一下\n自己有没有做好榜样……真的只是确认一下啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0083_1014_p", "source_sha256": "9b7717c36c55207439325a7b0da31c66dd15912b234d57be10fb8a3c7cd8ef11", "ja": "大丈夫。また心配になったら、いつでも確かめてくれ。\n響のことは、いつでもちゃんと見てるから。", "zh": "没事的，你要是又担心了，随时都能找我确认。\n毕竟我一直都关注着响啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0083_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "63308476abbc69b8eab436f0525a65e9cf0c973c2361c390c9b5c7c86fe41560", "ja": "……うん！\nありがとね、{$P$}！", "zh": "……嗯！\n谢谢你啰，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0083_1016_013hib", "source_sha256": "54cc597e1aa819f7439501bbf971c45b3b441061e128f0ba7e05aef01b5e8a84", "ja": "あっ、じゃあ先輩らしく、すぐに帰ってレッスン\nしなきゃ！　急ぐぞ、{$P$}！", "zh": "啊，那本人得拿出前辈风范，\n马上回去训练！快点走吧，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0083_1017_p", "source_sha256": "249e4900a5dacf7bb04790bc2f045377c56c0012769124a96069a030e0943c07", "ja": "おお、目がキラキラして……やる気だな、響！\nでも、ライブで疲れてるんじゃないのか？", "zh": "喔喔，看你眼神闪闪发亮……干劲十足喔，响！\n不过，刚开完演唱会，你不累吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0083_1018_013hib", "source_sha256": "82a966e45a55ce3bfa7b699d6edc4793502900718b74b057d0395ad56d22d312", "ja": "そんなの、なんくるないさー。自分カンペキだし！\nそれに～。", "zh": "总会有办法的啦──因为本人很完美啊！\n而且～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0083_1019_013hib", "source_sha256": "79f97f50aab31dd7cd858c7fd39013ce19d3efbd18cff4bd93bee9852f5c1bee", "ja": "自分はこれからも、ずーっと突っ走るからね！\nトップアイドルになるまで、ずーっと。えへへ！", "zh": "本人以后还是会继续冲下去！\n不断冲刺，直到成为顶尖偶像为止，嘿嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
